### Device settings that affect scraping

- [ ] USB debugging enabled
- [ ] Developer options: **animator / transition / window scale** set to off (recommended)
- [ ] Screen stays on during scrape
- [ ] Timeline open on **Rutas → Día** before `scrape` / `run`
- [ ] Bottom sheet expanded (full day list visible)

